 "title": {
  "rendered": "දස සිල් &#8211; පාලි, සිංහල, හා ඉංග්‍රීසියෙන්  The Ten Precepts in Pali, Sinhala and English"
 },
 "content": {
  "rendered": "<p><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_0 et-dark-mode-capable et_section_regular\" >\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_1\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_0  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_0  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_text_align_right-tablet\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_code_inner\"><label class='as-label'> පාලි </label>\n<label class='switch'>\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cb-pali\" checked>\n  <span class=\"slider round\"></span>\n</label>\n \n<label class='as-label'> සිංහල </label>\n<label class='switch'>\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cb-sinhala\" checked>\n  <span class=\"slider round\"></span>\n</label>\n \n<label class='as-label'> English</label>\n<label class='switch'>\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cb-english\" checked>\n  <span class=\"slider round\"></span>\n</label>\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_pb_column_1  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_1  et_pb_text_align_right\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_code_inner\"><div class=\"float\">\n<span class='as-label'>Font Size</span>\n<button class=\"as-btn\" id=\"btn-fs-minus\"> - </button>\n<span class=\"as-speed-txt\" id=\"font-size\"></span>\n<button class=\"as-btn\" id=\"btn-fs-plus\">+</button>\n</div></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_code et_pb_code_2  et_pb_text_align_right\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_code_inner\"><div class=\"float\">\n  <span class='as-label'>Auto-Scroll</span>\n\n<label class=\"switch\">\n  <input id='as-switch' type=\"checkbox\">\n  <span class=\"slider round\"></span>\n</label>\n   \n  <span class='as-label'>Speed</span>\n<button class=\"as-btn\" id=\"btn-minus\"> - </button>\n<span class=\"as-speed-txt\" id=\"as-speed\"></span>\n  <button class=\"as-btn\" id=\"btn-plus\">+</button>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_2\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_2  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_0 pali-quote  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>1. පාණාතිපාතා වේරමණී සික්ඛාපදං සමාදියාමි</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_1 sin-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>ප්‍රාණඝාතයෙන් වැළකීමේ ශික්ෂා පදය සමාදන් වෙමි.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_2 eng-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>I undertake the precept to refrain from destroying living creatures.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3 pali-quote  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>2. අදින්නාදානා වේරමණී සික්ඛාපදං සමාදියාමි</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4 sin-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>නුදුන් දෙය ගැනීමෙන් වැළකීමේ ශික්ෂා පදය සමාදන් වෙමි.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_5 eng-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span>I undertake the precept to refrain from taking that which is not given.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_6 pali-quote  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>3. අබ්‍රහ්මචරියා වේරමණී සික්ඛාපදං සමාදියාමි</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_7 sin-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>අබ්‍රහ්මචරියාවෙන් වැළකීමේ ශික්ෂා පදය සමාදන් වෙමි.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_8 eng-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span>I undertake the precept to refrain from sexual activity.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_9 pali-quote  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>4. මුසාවාදා වේරමණී සික්ඛාපදං සමාදියාමි</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_10 sin-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>මුසාවාදයෙන් වැළකීමේ ශික්ෂා පදය සමාදන් වෙමි.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_11 eng-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span>I undertake the precept to </span>refrain from incorrect speech<span>.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_12 pali-quote  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>5. සුරාමේරය මජ්ජපමාදට්ඨානා වේරමණී සික්ඛාපදං සමාදියාමි</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_13 sin-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>මදයට හා ප්‍රමාදයට කාරණ වූ රහමෙරින් වැළකීමේ ශික්ෂා පදය සමාදන් වෙමි.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_14 eng-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span>I undertake the precept to refrain from intoxicating drinks and drugs which lead to carelessness.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_15 pali-quote  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>6. විකාලභෝජනා වේරමණී සික්ඛාපදං සමාදියාමි</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_16 sin-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>විකල් බොජුනෙන් වැළකීමේ ශික්ෂා පදය සමාදන් වෙමි.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_17 eng-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span>I undertake the precept to refrain from eating at the forbidden time.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_18 pali-quote  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>7. නච්ච ගීත වාදිත විසූකදස්සනා වේරමණී සික්ඛාපදං සමාදියාමි</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_19 sin-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>නැටීම, ගැයීම, වැයීම, විසුලු බැලීම යන මෙයින් වැළකීමේ ශික්ෂා පදය සමාදන් වෙමි. </p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_20 eng-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span>I undertake the precept to refrain from dancing,singing, music, and going to see </span>entertainments<span>.</span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_21 pali-quote  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>8. මාලා ගන්ධවිලේපන ධාරණ මණ්ඩන විභූසනට්ඨානා වේරමණී සික්ඛාපදං සමාදියාමි</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_22 sin-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>මල්, ගඳ විලවුන් දැරීම, සැරසීම, වෙසෙසින් සැරසීම යන කාරණයෙන් වැළකීමේ ශික්ෂා පදය සමාදන් වෙමි.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_23 eng-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>I undertake the precept to refrain from wearing garlands, using perfumes, and beautifying the body with cosmetics.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_24 pali-quote  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>9. උච්චාසයන-මහාසයනා වේරමණී සික්ඛාපදං සමාදියාමි</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_25 sin-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>උසසුන්, මහ අස්නෙන් වැළකීමේ ශික්ෂා පදය සමාදන් වෙමි.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_26 eng-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">I undertake the precept to refrain from lying on a high or luxurious sleeping place.</div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_with_border et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_27 pali-quote  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>10. ජාතරූප-රජත පටිග්ගහණා වේරමණී සික්ඛාපදං සමාදියාමි</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_28 sin-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>රන්, රිදී, මසු, කහවණු පිළිගැනීමෙන් වැළකීමේ ශික්ෂා පදය සමාදන් වෙමි.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_29 eng-meaning  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\">I undertake the precept to refrain from accepting gold and silver (money).</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_2 et-dark-mode-capable et_section_regular\" >\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_3\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_3  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_30  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h2>Related Resources</h2></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div><div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_4  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_blog_0 et_pb_blog_grid_wrapper et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_blog_grid clearfix \">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_ajax_pagination_container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_salvattore_content\" data-columns>\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-864\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_has_overlay et_pb_blog_item_0_0 post-864 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail sticky hentry category-puja\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/buddha-puja/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/buddha-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"බුද්ධ පූජාව හා බෝධි පූජාව පාලි හා සිංහලෙන් &#8211; Buddha Puja and Bodhi Puja In Pali With Sinhala Meaning\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/buddha-scaled.jpg 479w, https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2020/01/buddha-400x250.jpg 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \"  width=\"400\" height=\"250\" /><span class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\" data-icon=\"U\"></span></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://namo.lk/buddha-puja/\">බුද්ධ පූජාව හා බෝධි පූජාව පාලි හා සිංහලෙන් &#8211; Buddha Puja and Bodhi Puja In Pali With Sinhala Meaning</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden\"><p>බුද්ධ පූජාව හා බෝධි පූජාව පාලි හා සිංහලෙන් &#8211; Buddha Puja and Bodhi Puja In Pali With Sinhala Meaning</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-251\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_has_overlay et_pb_blog_item_0_1 post-251 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail sticky hentry category-tripitaka category-khuddakanikaya category-sutta category-suttanipata category-uragavagga\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/karaneeyametta-sutta/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/buddha_gold2-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"කරණීයමෙත්ත සුත්තං (කරණීයමෙත්ත සූත්‍රය) පාළි, සිංහල, හා ඉංග්‍රීසියෙන් KaraneeyaMetta Sutta in Pali, Sinhala, and English Translation\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/buddha_gold2-scaled-e1586504253430.jpg 479w, https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/buddha_gold2-400x250.jpg 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \"  width=\"400\" height=\"250\" /><span class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\" data-icon=\"U\"></span></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://namo.lk/karaneeyametta-sutta/\">කරණීයමෙත්ත සුත්තං (කරණීයමෙත්ත සූත්‍රය) පාළි, සිංහල, හා ඉංග්‍රීසියෙන් KaraneeyaMetta Sutta in Pali, Sinhala, and English Translation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden\"><p>මෛත්‍රිය පැතිරවීම පිළිබඳ බුදු රජාණන් වහන්සේ වදාළ දෙසුම &#8211; KaraneeyaMetta Sutta — The Buddha&#8217;s Words on Loving-Kindness &#8211; The Hymn of Universal Love &#8211; Loving-Kindness -The Discourse on Loving-kindness &#8211; Good Will</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-209\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_has_overlay et_pb_blog_item_0_2 post-209 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail sticky hentry category-tripitaka category-chullavagga category-khuddakanikaya category-sutta category-suttanipata\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/rathana-sutta/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/rathana_sutraya-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"රතන සුත්තං (රතන සූත්‍රය) පාලි සිංහල පරිවර්ථනය &#8211; Rathana Suthraya (Sutta) in Pali with Sinhala Translation\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/rathana_sutraya.jpg 479w, https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/rathana_sutraya-400x250.jpg 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \"  width=\"400\" height=\"250\" /><span class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\" data-icon=\"U\"></span></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://namo.lk/rathana-sutta/\">රතන සුත්තං (රතන සූත්‍රය) පාලි සිංහල පරිවර්ථනය &#8211; Rathana Suthraya (Sutta) in Pali with Sinhala Translation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden\"><p>අතීතයේ විශාලා මහනුවර මහා දුර්භීක්ෂයක් ඇති විය. ආහාර දුර්ලභත්වයෙන් මිනිස්සු මැරෙන්නට වූහ. මළ සිරුරු නුවරින් බැහැර කළහ. මිනී කුණුගන්ඳින් අමනුෂ්‍යයෝ නුවරට ඇතුල් වූහ&#8230;</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-172\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_has_overlay et_pb_blog_item_0_3 post-172 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail sticky hentry category-tripitaka category-chullavagga category-khuddakanikaya category-sutta category-suttanipata\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/maha-mangala-sutta/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/buddha11-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"මහාමංගල සුත්තං (මහා මංගල සූත්‍රය) පාලි හා සිංහලෙන්  Maha Mangala Sutta in Pali and Sinhala Translation\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/buddha11-scaled.jpg 479w, https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2019/04/buddha11-400x250.jpg 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \"  width=\"400\" height=\"250\" /><span class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\" data-icon=\"U\"></span></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://namo.lk/maha-mangala-sutta/\">මහාමංගල සුත්තං (මහා මංගල සූත්‍රය) පාලි හා සිංහලෙන්  Maha Mangala Sutta in Pali and Sinhala Translation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden\"><p>මංගල කරුණු ගැන බුදු රජාණන් වහන්සේ වදාළ දෙසුම</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-2597\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_has_overlay et_pb_blog_item_0_4 post-2597 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-pirith\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/seevali-piritha-with-sinhala-translation/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-23-at-12.54.54-pm-400x250.png\" alt=\"සීවලි පිරිත පාලි හා සිංහලෙන් &#8211; Seevali Piritha In Pali With Sinhala Translation\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-23-at-12.54.54-pm.png 479w, https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Screenshot-2026-10-23-at-12.54.54-pm-400x250.png 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \"  width=\"400\" height=\"250\" /><span class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\" data-icon=\"U\"></span></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://namo.lk/seevali-piritha-with-sinhala-translation/\">සීවලි පිරිත පාලි හා සිංහලෙන් &#8211; Seevali Piritha In Pali With Sinhala Translation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden\"><p>පූරෙන්තා පාරමි සබ්බෙසබ්බෙ පච්චෙකනායකා සීවලි ගුණතේජෙන පරිත්තං තං හණාමහේන ජාලිති ති ජාලිතාමි ආ ඊ ඌ ආම් ඉ ස්වාහාසියලු පාරමිතාවන් සම්පූර්ණ කොට සියලු ධර්මයන් අවබෝධ කර ගත්තාවූ ඒ සීවලී මහ රහත්න් වහන්සේගේ ගුණ තේජානු භාවයෙන් මේ පිරිත් අසන්නෙමු.බුද්ධසාමි බුද්ධසත්‍යාම්...</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-2564\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_has_overlay et_pb_blog_item_0_5 post-2564 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-pirith\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/angulimala-piritha/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/alexey-a-l-o-h-a-WQC9DhFPLO0-unsplash-400x250.jpg\" alt=\"අංගුලිමාල පිරිත පාලි ​හා සිංහලෙ​න්  Angulimala Piritha In Pali With Sinhala Translation\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/alexey-a-l-o-h-a-WQC9DhFPLO0-unsplash-scaled.jpg 479w, https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/alexey-a-l-o-h-a-WQC9DhFPLO0-unsplash-400x250.jpg 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \"  width=\"400\" height=\"250\" /><span class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\" data-icon=\"U\"></span></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://namo.lk/angulimala-piritha/\">අංගුලිමාල පිරිත පාලි ​හා සිංහලෙ​න්  Angulimala Piritha In Pali With Sinhala Translation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden\"><p>පරිත්තං යං භණන්තස්ස නිසින්නට්ඨාන ධොවනංමේ අංගුලිමාල පිරිත දේශනා කිරීමට දේශකයා ඉඳගත් ආසනය සේදුඋදකම්පි විනාසෙසි සබ්බ මෙව පරිස්සයංජලය පවා සියලු උවදුරු විනාශ කරයි. සොත්ථිනා ගබ්භවුට්ඨානං යඤ්ච සාදෙති තං ඛණෙමේ පිරිත ප්‍රසූත නො කළ හැකිව පීඩා විඳිමින් සිටි මවකට සෙත් කරනු...</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-2452\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_has_overlay et_pb_blog_item_0_6 post-2452 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-majjhimanikaya category-mulapannasapali category-opammavaggo category-sutta\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/nivapa-sutta/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/buddha-400x250.jpeg\" alt=\"නිවාප සුත්‍රය (නිවාපසුත්තං) සහ සිංහල අර්ථය &#8211; Nivapa Sutta with Sinhala Translation\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/buddha.jpeg 479w, https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/buddha-400x250.jpeg 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \"  width=\"400\" height=\"250\" /><span class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\" data-icon=\"U\"></span></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://namo.lk/nivapa-sutta/\">නිවාප සුත්‍රය (නිවාපසුත්තං) සහ සිංහල අර්ථය &#8211; Nivapa Sutta with Sinhala Translation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden\"><p>එවං මෙ සුතං - එකං සමයං භගවා සාවත්ථියං විහරති ජෙතවනෙ අනාථපිණ්ඩිකස්ස ආරාමෙ. තත්‍ර ඛො භගවා භික්ඛූ ආමන්තෙසි - ‘‘භික්ඛවො’’ති. ‘‘භදන්තෙ’’ති තෙ භික්ඛූ භගවතො පච්චස්සොසුං. භගවා එතදවොච - ‘‘න , භික්ඛවෙ, නෙවාපිකො නිවාපං නිවපති මිගජාතානං - ‘ඉමං මෙ නිවාපං නිවුත්තං මිගජාතා...</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-2194\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_has_overlay et_pb_blog_item_0_7 post-2194 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-tripitaka category-khuddakanikaya category-sutta category-suttanipata category-uragavagga\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/vasala-sutta/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/amit-kumar-cT4wxa5jFKU-unsplash-scaled-e1654566146766-400x250.jpeg\" alt=\"වසල සුත්තං(වසල සූත්‍ර​ය) සිංහල හා ඉංග්‍රීසි පරිවර්ථන &#8211; Vasala Sutta with Sinhala &#038; English Translations\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/amit-kumar-cT4wxa5jFKU-unsplash-scaled-e1654566146766.jpeg 479w, https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/amit-kumar-cT4wxa5jFKU-unsplash-scaled-e1654566146766-400x250.jpeg 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \"  width=\"400\" height=\"250\" /><span class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\" data-icon=\"U\"></span></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://namo.lk/vasala-sutta/\">වසල සුත්තං(වසල සූත්‍ර​ය) සිංහල හා ඉංග්‍රීසි පරිවර්ථන &#8211; Vasala Sutta with Sinhala &#038; English Translations</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden\"><p>ඒවං මේ සුතං. ඒකං සමයං භගවා සාවත්ථියං විහරති ජේතවනේ අනාථපිණ්ඩිකස්ස ආරාමේ. අථ ඛෝ භගවා පුබ්බන්හ සමයං නිවාසෙත්වා පත්තචීවරමාදාය සාවත්ථියං පිණ්ඩාය පාවිසි. තේන ඛෝ සමයේන අග්ගික භාරද්වාජස්ස බ්‍රාහ්මණස්ස නිවේසනේ අග්ගි පජ්ජලිතෝ හෝති ආහුති පග්ගහිතා. අථ ඛෝ භගවා සාවත්ථියං සපදානං...</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-1970\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_has_overlay et_pb_blog_item_0_8 post-1970 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-tripitaka category-deeghanikaya category-patikavagga category-sutta\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/chakkavatti-seehanada-sutra/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/jonathan-borba-p110THloDYg-unsplash-400x250.jpeg\" alt=\"චක්කවත්ති සීහනාද සුත්තං(සූත්‍රය) සිංහල අර්ථය සම​ග &#8211; Chakkavatti Seehanada Sutra with Sinhala Translation\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/jonathan-borba-p110THloDYg-unsplash-scaled.jpeg 479w, https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/jonathan-borba-p110THloDYg-unsplash-400x250.jpeg 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \"  width=\"400\" height=\"250\" /><span class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\" data-icon=\"U\"></span></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://namo.lk/chakkavatti-seehanada-sutra/\">චක්කවත්ති සීහනාද සුත්තං(සූත්‍රය) සිංහල අර්ථය සම​ග &#8211; Chakkavatti Seehanada Sutra with Sinhala Translation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden\"><p>සක්විති රජු ගැන සිහනදක් ලෙසින් වදාළ දෙසු​ම.<br />\nමා විසින් මෙසේ අසන ලදී. එක් සමයෙක්හි භාග්‍යවතුන් වහන්සේ මගධ ජනපදයෙහි මාතුලා නුවර වැඩවසන සේක. එහිදී භාග්‍යවතුන් වහන්සේ “මහණෙනි” යි භික්ෂූන් ඇමතූ සේක. “පින්වතුන් වහන්සැ” යි ඒ භික්ෂූහු භාග්‍යවතුන් වහන්සේට පිළිවදන් දුන්නාහු ය. භාග්‍යවතුන් වහන්සේ මෙය වදාළ සේක.</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<article id=\"post-1889\" class=\"et_pb_post clearfix et_pb_has_overlay et_pb_blog_item_0_9 post-1889 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-tripitaka category-majjhimanikaya category-sutta category-uparipannasapali\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_image_container\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/isigili-sutta/\" class=\"entry-featured-image-url\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/artem-beliaikin-df3tLNzoBYM-unsplash-400x250.jpeg\" alt=\"ඉසිගි​ලි සුත්තං (ඉසිගි​ලි සූත්‍රය) සිංහල අර්ථය සමග. Isigili Sutta in Pali with Sinhala Translation\" class=\"\" srcset=\"https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/artem-beliaikin-df3tLNzoBYM-unsplash-scaled.jpeg 479w, https://namo.lk/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/artem-beliaikin-df3tLNzoBYM-unsplash-400x250.jpeg 480w \" sizes=\"(max-width:479px) 479px, 100vw \"  width=\"400\" height=\"250\" /><span class=\"et_overlay et_pb_inline_icon\" data-icon=\"U\"></span></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"entry-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://namo.lk/isigili-sutta/\">ඉසිගි​ලි සුත්තං (ඉසිගි​ලි සූත්‍රය) සිංහල අර්ථය සමග. Isigili Sutta in Pali with Sinhala Translation</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner et_multi_view_hidden\"><p>බුද්ධ, ධම්ම, සංඝ යන ත්‍රිවිධ රත්නයේ ගුණ දැක්වෙන පිරිත් නිමවා පසේ බුදුවරයින් ගේ ගුණ දැක්වෙන එකම සූත්‍රය වන ඉසිගිලි සූත්‍රය දක්වන ලදී.</p>\n</div></div>\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t</div><div><div class=\"pagination clearfix\">\n\t<div class=\"alignleft\"><a href=\"https://namo.lk/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/page/2/?per_page=50&#038;page=1&#038;orderby=date&#038;order=asc&#038;et_blog\" >&laquo; Older Entries</a></div>\n\t<div class=\"alignright\"></div>\n</div></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div></p>\n",
